OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant effort' put into
OL,4,Adrones investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Significant effort and resource" have
OL,7,Fbeen put into an investigation after
OL,8,Fflights were disrupted by drones,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.
OL,11,FInbound and outbound flights in Jersey
OL,12,Fwere affected on Friday and Saturday
OL,13,Fevening at the island's airport,
OL,14,Fcausing major disruption.
OL,16,FStates of Jersey Police reassured
OL,17,Fislanders that there was specialist
OL,18,Fequipment in place that could assist if
OL,19,Fit was to happen again.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
